        70.86609649658203,
        671.3328247070312,
        447.4375,
        685.0368041992188
      ],
      "text": "Tracers refer to the communication with the patient – including via SMS, telephone (voice) calls or home visits. 71",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
