      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        705.8023071289062,
        526.6128540039062,
        719.5062866210938
      ],
      "text": "Material support can be food or financial support: meals, food baskets, food supplements, food vouchers, transport subsidies, living  73",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        718.6023559570312,
        526.4658203125,
        729.1063232421875
      ],
      "text": "allowance, housing incentives or financial bonus. This support addresses indirect costs incurred by patients or their attendants in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
